# PRELIMINARY ppRef2024 R4 MC Nominal: supplied 20261116 residual pair table.
# Requires checksum-checked ROOT installation; see README.md and manifest.json.
# Jet ID ON by request; original table was derived with Jet ID OFF.
# No new closure is claimed. Ordinary EEC only; no particle/unfolding responses.
# 15-200 GeV application test: 15-20 uses the stored 10-20 correction bin.
# Run from repository root. Trigger/sample applicability remains a user input.
DataType 12
McCorrelationType 0
MatchJets 0
TriggerSelection 0
FilledHistograms 31
JetType 1
JetAxis 1
JetEtaCut 1.6
MinJetPtCut 15
MaxJetPtCut 200
CutBadPhi 0
CutWithEtaCM 0
MinMaxTrackPtFraction 0.01
MaxMaxTrackPtFraction 0.98
JetUncertainty 0
Run3JetID 1
Run3JetIDTable MiniPOG20261108
Run3JetQA 1
Run3JEC 1
Run3UsePpL1FastJet 0
ApplyJetVeto 1
JetVetoMapFile jetVetoMaps/pp2024/Summer24Prompt24_RunBCDEFGHI.root
JetVetoMapHistogram jetvetomap_all
JetVetoPtConvention stored
JetVetoInputMinPt 15
Run3TrackSelection Nominal
TrackEtaCut 2.4
MinTrackPtCut 0.5
MaxTrackPtCut 500
MaxTrackPtRelativeError 0.1
VertexMaxDistance 3
SubeventCut 2
TrackEfficiencyVariation 0
JetPtWeight 0
DisableTrackPairEfficiencyCorrection 0
ZVertexCut 15
LowPtHatCut -15
HighPtHatCut 5020
MultiplicityMode 0
JetRadius 0.4
WeightExponent 1 2
SmearDeltaR 0
SmearEnergyWeight 0
JetPtBinEdgesEEC 15 20 30 40 80 120 160 200
TrackPtBinEdgesEEC 0.5 1 1.5 2 2.5 3 3.5 4 300
SkipCovarianceMatrix 0
MinJetPtUnfoldingReco 20
MinJetPtUnfoldingTruth 10
CentralityBinEdges -1 100
TrackPtBinEdges 0.7 1 2 3 4 8 12 300
PtHatBinEdges 0 30 50 80 120 170 220 280 370 460
BackgroundMethods 0
MegaSkimMixing 1
EventMatchForMixing 1
BinnedMixing 0
VzMixingBins -0.5 1
HiBinMixingBins -0.5 1
HFEnergyMixingBins 0 1
MultiplicityMixingBins -0.5 1
HFEnergyShift 0
DebugLevel 1
MaxEventsPerFile 1000
ChannelRadiusCode 4
MinPairTrackPt 2
FirstUnfoldedJetPtBin 0
LastUnfoldedJetPtBin 6
Run3TrackPairCorrectionFile trackCorrectionTables/pp2024/pair/20261116/Nominal/trackPairEfficiencyCorrection_pp_run3-an751-v6-32dr-lowpt.root
